      <p begin="00:09.160" end="00:11.980" ttm:agent="v1">Can you see huh?</p>

      <p begin="00:11.980" end="00:14.040" ttm:agent="v1">떨어진 한 방울 drip</p>

      <p begin="00:14.040" end="00:16.680" ttm:agent="v1">투명한 내 안에 섞여 들지</p>

      <p begin="00:16.680" end="00:20.120" ttm:agent="v1">아무렇지 않은 듯 keep on moving (yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:20.120" end="00:22.850" ttm:agent="v1">Impurities, show you my impurities</p>

      <p begin="00:22.850" end="00:24.460" ttm:agent="v1">욕심내 더 like a witch</p>

      <p begin="00:24.460" end="00:27.010" ttm:agent="v1">Show you real me 검붉어지는 빛</p>

      <p begin="00:27.010" end="00:30.850" ttm:agent="v1">강렬하게 반짝여 glittery things (yeah, things)</p>

      <p begin="00:30.850" end="00:33.050" ttm:agent="v1">Impurities, show you my impurities</p>

      <p begin="00:33.050" end="00:36.330" ttm:agent="v1">천천히 밟아가 경계선을 넘어가</p>

      <p begin="00:36.330" end="00:38.980" ttm:agent="v1">검게 휩싸인 욕망들의 deep sign</p>

